{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-04-25 11:30:00', 'title': 'HII ANNOUNCES NEW VICE PRESIDENT OF CONTRACTS AND PRICING AT INGALLS SHIPBUILDING', 'text': 'PASCAGOULA, MISS., APRIL 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ALL-DOMAIN DEFENSE AND TECHNOLOGIES PARTNER HII (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT STEPHEN FITTS HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO VICE PRESIDENT OF CONTRACTS AND PRICING AT ITS INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION. FITTS SUCCEEDS ERIC CROOKER WHO ASSUMED A NEW ROLE IN MARCH AS VICE PRESIDENT OF INFRASTRUCTURE AND SUSTAINABILITY.'}